WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:09.800
Football fans celebrate with flags, scarves, face paint, drums and songs - and every nation does it a little differently.

2
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.400
Welcome it: that passion is what makes the tournament special.

3
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.900
Treat every team's fans exactly the same - no favourites.

4
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
During national anthems, stay respectful and keep watching the crowd.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.500
If you see a prohibited item or offensive behaviour, don't argue - tell your supervisor, and Security will deal with it.

